  "description": "Lifecycle, messages, QueryInterface and tuning, by hand from 1.1, 1.3, 1.4, 3, 4.21 and 7. QueryInterface answers 0x1, 0xA818ED1B, 0x452294AA, 0xE4FDA3D4 and nothing else. Init: services, AddAgent at level 6 (Month 0x66956816) then level 7 (Year 0x66956817), message server; a second Init returns true with no call. With the shipped tuning a new instance gets styles 8192-8195, years between 5, index 0. DoMessage returns true for every message; only Year changes the styles. A Grow with no configuration registers the (wealth 1, purpose 1) filter (ListPossibleLotConfigurations gives 5: nothing is pushed; pass 2 stops since best is 1). Shutdown: message server, agent, each cached filter, services; the filter cache is emptied, the styles are kept; a second Shutdown returns true with no call. Init failures: no services -> false after the services call; no simulator -> false (no agent added); no message server -> false after both agents. Each leaves the instance uninitialised but configured. No exemplar: the reader defaults (overbuild 1.5, reoccupy {0, 1.2}, redevelop 1.5, demolition {1, 0.2}, new lot {10, 5}, variation 0.2, minVacancy {0.01, 0.1}, kick-out true, no styles) and years between 40; before Init the constructor's minVacancy is {0.1, 0.1}. A custom exemplar: overbuild 2, reoccupy with one float ([choice]: the missing second value keeps the default 1.2; the original reads past the array), kick-out false, styles {0x3000}, years between 7; the other values take the defaults.",
